A. chain inequalities, exact:
   phi_k(2/3) = 4/27 + 4 g_{k+1}/9 + g_k/9 + (s_k - 1)/9      identity holds
   phi_k(1/3) = -4/27 + g_{k+1}/9 + 4 g_k/9 + (s_k + 1)/9     identity holds
   random search, s_0 = 1, n = 1..8, 200000 trials: least max|phi| found 0.148148148  (4/27 = 0.148148148)

